LiteRT aa9e40cd5 (2026-11-09) "Stage spatial tensor bindings while background
command buffer preparation runs", verbatim (`git show --format= aa9e40cd5`).
patch_c_api.sh section 10b adds it to the litert archive.
LiteRT-LM #4460: on WebGPU (Windows D3D12, Linux Vulkan) BindSpatialTensor for
the next prefill_8 step mutated context tensor bindings while the background
thread was still recording the previous ping-pong slot, so prompts prefilled in
8-token chunks gave empty or wrong replies. Google's 0.20.0 binaries carry the
fix; the v0.20.0 tag pins LiteRT bf49eb62 (2026-11-06), which does not. Drop
this patch once the LiteRT pin contains aa9e40cd5.

